# Generated output files (project root only)
/DESIGN.md
/DESIGN.preview.html

# Playwright MCP runtime cache (screenshots, console logs, snapshots)
.playwright-mcp/

# Internal research notes, brainstorming, strategy docs (not for public repo)
research/

# Scenario test archive (regenerable; rerun `npm test` to recreate)
test/scenarios/archive/

# Local experiment runs (regenerable via /omd-lab-* skills, not for public repo)
.experiments/

# Local experiment scratch — gallery + brand mockups + applepresso journey.
# Iterative outputs (v1/v2 drafts, build scripts, source crops); not for public repo.
experiments/

# Per-harness-run artifacts (regenerable; not for public repo)
.omd/

# npm pack tarball outputs (build artifacts)
*.tgz

# The self-contained reference collector and its third-party notices are
# checked-in package inputs. `npm run build` must reproduce the same bytes so a
# clean source install cannot change shape while another build is running.

# Self-install test artifacts inside web/ (regenerable via npx)
web/.claude/
web/.codex/
web/.omd/
web/.husky/
web/.sundae/

# Self-install artifacts at repo root (canonical sources: skills/, agents/, .claude/).
# `omd install-skills` writes installed-skill-marked copies here when dogfooding
# the codex / generic-agent channels locally.
.codex/
# Keep the canonical Codex agent mirror reviewable in clean clones while
# continuing to ignore dogfooded skills, data, and other installer output.
!.codex/
.codex/*
!.codex/agents/
.codex/agents/*
!.codex/agents/*.toml
.agents/skills/omd*/
.agents/skills/claude-design/

# Claude scheduled-task lock (per-machine runtime state)
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Local convenience symlink: `references` → `web/references` (don't commit;
# repo canonical path is web/references/)
/references

# Local screenshot / test artifacts at repo root (regenerable, not for repo)
/*.png
/*.jpg
/refero-sections.json

# Promo video archive — /omd-batch-launch outputs (hyperframes projects + MP4)
.promo/

# oh-my-design-mcp bundled data (populated by scripts/sync-data.mjs at build time)
packages/mcp/data/references/
packages/mcp/data/reference-manifest.json
packages/mcp/data/reference-ast.json
web/src/data/reference-ast.generated.json
packages/mcp/dist/

# AI-generated internal audit/analysis docs (keep local, not for public repo)
data/audit/

# Analytics pull — service-account keys (NEVER commit) + raw API dumps (carry
# search queries / geo / PII-adjacent data). Synthesized reports go to data/audit/.
scripts/analytics/.secrets/
data/analytics/

# Deterministic reverify queue/task packets (CI artifact, never source data)
artifacts/reverify/
artifacts/reference-evidence/

# Benchmark outputs and third-party packs live in the immutable store
# (~/.omd/bench-store) with SHA manifests committed under
# benchmarks/ui-resolve-bench/manifests/. `scripts/bench-store.mjs --verify`
# checks custody; REPRODUCE.md explains how a stranger re-runs everything.
# reports/ is governed by its own benchmarks/ui-resolve-bench/reports/.gitignore,
# which keeps the runs git binds by path and drops the rest. It has to live
# there: git does not descend into an excluded directory, so a `!` negation
# written here could never re-include anything under an ignored reports/.
benchmarks/ui-resolve-bench/e2e/
benchmarks/ui-resolve-bench/fixtures/competitor-skills-2.0/

# SuperClaude plugin scratch output.
claudedocs/

# Ouroboros runtime state.
.ouroboros/

# Wave agents (F3 / review) write scratch measurement scripts to the repo root.
# 72 of them were left behind after waves 27-35 — untracked, so nothing shipped,
# but they sit in `git status` and hide real changes. The prompts tell agents to
# measure; they do not tell them where to put the scripts.
/tmp-*

# T3 채점 패킷 시험 세션 (build-packets.mjs --test) — 채점에 쓰지 않는다
test-v2/90-comparison/sessions/_test/

# T3 첫 캡처 PNG는 render.html에서 결정론적으로 재생성된다(바이트 동일 확인) — 매니페스트·verify.json만 커밋
test-v2/90-comparison/captures/**/*.png
